    <node id="Generative Model">
      <data key="d0">Generative Model</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A generative model is conditioned using pattern-based KCs to produce personalized worked examples and practice problems.&lt;SEP&gt;The generative model proposed in this work hierarchically groups low-level motion cues and high-level appearance features into particles, capturing coherently and independently moveable physical entities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-421873c316a2a72fa1ccf5068ebdfe92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a796b36576b3a3580d3e19194a2554bd</data>
