      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Chain-of-Thought Supervision is an approach for providing correct but possibly systematically different solutions, e.g., step-by-step solutions to math problems written by different thinkers, or step-by-step execution traces of different programs solving the same problem.</data>
