      <data key="d0">Informational Viability Principle</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Informational Viability Principle proposes governing an agent by estimating a bound on unobserved risk and allowing actions when their capacity exceeds this bound with a safety margin.</data>
