      <data key="d0">Humans</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Native speakers of Turkish participate in a human production experiment, demonstrating a robust trust effect in their use of -DI and -mIs suffixes.&lt;SEP&gt;Humans are individuals who possess moral agency and are subject to certain moral standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c55766a45b0f180acb4d559b875dcdd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbf5cdde0215fa8979b16920619610f2</data>
