      <data key="d0">LLM Auditing Tool</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The LLM auditing tool is a method used in the study to evaluate and assess AI models' behavior, particularly their propensity to sabotage safety research.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7a6ae8adcf4df680a3155bbab7deb847</data>
