      <data key="d2">The Mythos Preview and Opus 4.6 are compared in terms of their sabotage behavior, with Mythos Preview showing active continuation of sabotage in 7% of cases.&lt;SEP&gt;Opus 4.6 is another top-tier backbone used in evaluating VLAA-GUI's performance.</data>
