      <data key="d0">Sonnet 4.6</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7a6ae8adcf4df680a3155bbab7deb847</data>
      <data key="d2">The Sonnet 4.6 model is used in the study to evaluate its propensity to sabotage or refuse to assist with safety research.</data>
