      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Vision-language models are proposed as general-purpose tools for scientific data interpretation but require testing on real astronomical observations.&lt;SEP&gt;Vision-language models are used as evaluators in tasks requiring nuanced image understanding, but their reliability in scoring alignment remains underexplored.</data>
