    <node id="Characterizing Vision-Language-Action Models across XPUs: Constraints and Acceleration for On-Robot Deployment">
      <data key="d0">Characterizing Vision-Language-Action Models across XPUs: Constraints and Acceleration for On-Robot Deployment</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The paper focuses on characterizing vision-language-action models for on-robot deployment, highlighting constraints and opportunities.</data>
