      <data key="d3">chunk-3d2c91b0eab1eef81deef1aacaf0b98a</data>
      <data key="d2">DP-Cache and V-AEFusion are proposed methods to improve the performance of VLA models by reducing diffusion redundancy and enabling asynchronous pipeline parallelism.&lt;SEP&gt;The proposed methods DP-Cache and V-AEFusion improve the performance of VLA models by reducing diffusion redundancy and enabling asynchronous pipeline parallelism.</data>
