      <data key="d0">AVES-DPO</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-05a4ca61ae3ed284142fb22c23657755</data>
      <data key="d2">AVES-DPO aligns LVLMs using in-distribution data derived from the model's intrinsic knowledge to mitigate hallucinations.</data>
