    <node id="Hallucinations">
      <data key="d0">Hallucinations</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-05a4ca61ae3ed284142fb22c23657755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3ba0f324a606c4227526581aeedb047</data>
      <data key="d2">The consensus-based verification mechanism diagnoses hallucinations and guides the model to self-correct.&lt;SEP&gt;Hallucinations refer to outputs in LVLMs that are not grounded in the visual input.</data>
