    <node id="Certified Geometric Robustness -- Super-DeepG">
      <data key="d0">Certified Geometric Robustness -- Super-DeepG</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">Certified geometric robustness -- Super-DeepG is a dataset for formal verification of neural networks against geometric perturbations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c00a185631f5831f02808b92381af986</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779149342</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Safety-Critical Applications">
      <data key="d0">Safety-Critical Applications</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Safety-critical applications require performing as expected in normal operations and are often insensitive to small geometric perturbations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c00a185631f5831f02808b92381af986</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779149342</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Image Processing Functions">
      <data key="d0">Image Processing Functions</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Image processing functions are required to be insensitive to small geometric perturbations such as rotation, scaling, shearing or translation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c00a185631f5831f02808b92381af986</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779149349</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Neural Networks">
      <data key="d0">Neural Networks</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Neural networks are the focus of formal verification against geometric perturbations on their image dataset.&lt;SEP&gt;Neural networks are trained to learn task-relevant representations from data, which falls within the Explainable AI (XAI) domain.&lt;SEP&gt;Neural networks are used both to generate content-encoding watermarks and to embed them imperceptibly into images while ensuring robust extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;Neural networks exhibit a remarkable degree of representational convergence across diverse architectures, training objectives, and even data modalities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c00a185631f5831f02808b92381af986&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee5c0df881cd5e01e420307a4a987536&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dd66828791112b5ce1fbb9c8c1061f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47fa4dc17610cc2664e562c4d35e3a45</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779215175</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
