    <node id="Controllable Diffusion Methods">
      <data key="d0">Controllable Diffusion Methods</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Controllable diffusion methods have expanded the practical utility of diffusion models but are typically developed as isolated systems with incompatible training pipelines and parameter formats.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f36584a3c17d75781a357f1a3e17848d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779150335</data>
