      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation) is another capability carrier supported by the Diffusion Templates framework for heterogeneous capability injection.&lt;SEP&gt;LoRA is a widely adopted parameter-efficient fine-tuning method.</data>
