    <node id="Fast Adversarial Training">
      <data key="d0">Fast Adversarial Training</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Fast Adversarial Training is a method for enhancing neural network robustness against adversarial attacks, but it is prone to catastrophic overfitting.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1275d6a1c7d7e5d54c4d93057e8775c3</data>
