    <node id="Neural Network">
      <data key="d0">Neural Network</data>
      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">A Neural Network is an artificial intelligence model used for image classification and other tasks that can be vulnerable to catastrophic overfitting when using Fast Adversarial Training.&lt;SEP&gt;A neural network is a type of machine learning model used for image and signal processing, among other applications.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1275d6a1c7d7e5d54c4d93057e8775c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17e3402c333a7100fbe7f64435a9853c</data>
