      <data key="d0">Adversarial Attacks</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Adversarial Attacks are a type of attack on neural networks where the input data is modified to cause incorrect predictions, which can lead to catastrophic overfitting in Fast Adversarial Training.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1275d6a1c7d7e5d54c4d93057e8775c3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
