      <data key="d3">chunk-1275d6a1c7d7e5d54c4d93057e8775c3</data>
      <data key="d2">Vanilla Fine Tuning is a mitigation strategy used to recalibrate CO-affected model parameters and mitigate Catastrophic Overfitting.</data>
