      <data key="d2">Linear Probing is a mitigation strategy used to recalibrate CO-affected model parameters and mitigate Catastrophic Overfitting.&lt;SEP&gt;Linear probing is a method used in mechanistic interpretability research to analyze emotion in language models.</data>
