    <node id="H2 (Hydrogen)">
      <data key="d0">H2 (Hydrogen)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">H2, or hydrogen, is a clean-burning fuel used in high-efficient gas turbines featuring low NOx combustion in premix mode.</data>
