    <node id="Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)">
      <data key="d0">Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)</data>
      <data key="d1">technique</data>
      <data key="d2">RAG offers a training-free alternative by providing static API documentation, which typically provides isolated definitions and leaves a fundamental knowledge gap.&lt;SEP&gt;Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) is a method that uses dense vector retrieval to improve generation performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Retrieval-Augmented Generation is a technique that will be integrated with Chain-of-Thought prompting to improve accuracy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77c51309c1da2a8788990e7a8432dfd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1194bf14d2da400395521fd4c013e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46fac54945420c8890071bb2eb2ecd93</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779206107</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="NdonnxEval">
      <data key="d0">NdonnxEval</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">NdonnxEval is a benchmark used to evaluate MEMCoder's performance in code generation tasks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77c51309c1da2a8788990e7a8432dfd3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779152668</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="NumbaEval">
      <data key="d0">NumbaEval</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">NumbaEval is another benchmark used to evaluate MEMCoder's performance in code generation tasks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77c51309c1da2a8788990e7a8432dfd3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779152672</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Usage Guidelines">
      <data key="d0">Usage Guidelines</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Usage Guidelines are distilled lessons from the model's own problem-solving trajectories that MEMCoder captures and evolves across two dimensions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77c51309c1da2a8788990e7a8432dfd3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779152672</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Multi-dimensional Evolving Memory">
      <data key="d0">Multi-dimensional Evolving Memory</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">MEMCoder introduces a Multi-dimensional Evolving Memory to capture Usage Guidelines, which operates in an automated closed loop by using objective execution feedback.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77c51309c1da2a8788990e7a8432dfd3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779152676</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Adaptive ToR">
      <data key="d0">Adaptive ToR</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Adaptive ToR is a complexity-aware retrieval architecture that dynamically configures retrieval topology based on query characteristics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e597d51a989e3ab5874950fc7bfbd276</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779152845</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Query Tree Classifier">
      <data key="d0">Query Tree Classifier</data>
      <data key="d1">component</data>
      <data key="d2">The Query Tree Classifier computes a Query Complexity Index from weighted linguistic signals to route queries to either a rapid single-step path or an adaptive-depth hierarchical path.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e597d51a989e3ab5874950fc7bfbd276</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779152845</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Tree-Based Retrieval module">
      <data key="d0">Tree-Based Retrieval module</data>
      <data key="d1">component</data>
      <data key="d2">The Tree-Based Retrieval module recursively decomposes complex queries into focused sub-queries calibrated to predicted complexity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e597d51a989e3ab5874950fc7bfbd276</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779152852</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Adaptive Pruning Module">
      <data key="d0">Adaptive Pruning Module</data>
      <data key="d1">component</data>
      <data key="d2">The Adaptive Pruning Module employs two-stage filtering combining quantitative similarity gating with semantic relevance evaluation to suppress exponential node growth.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e597d51a989e3ab5874950fc7bfbd276</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779152852</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Retrieval Reranking Layer">
      <data key="d0">Retrieval Reranking Layer</data>
      <data key="d1">component</data>
      <data key="d2">The Retrieval Reranking Layer features a deduplicator-first pipeline and global LLM rescoring for production efficiency.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e597d51a989e3ab5874950fc7bfbd276</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779152856</data>
