    <node id="System-on-Chip (SoC)">
      <data key="d0">System-on-Chip (SoC)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">System-on-Chip refers to the integration of multiple components on a single chip, requiring high-fidelity reference models for early architecture exploration and verification.</data>
