      <data key="d2">The Prover owns and provides access to the dataset for auditing.&lt;SEP&gt;The dataset used for fine-tuning Qwen2.5-Coder-14B consists of code files, developer queries, and corresponding diagram representations in a structured JSON format.&lt;SEP&gt;The dataset used for training and testing symbolic regression models is not explicitly mentioned, but it is implied as a crucial component of the process.&lt;SEP&gt;The dataset used in this research is not explicitly mentioned, but it likely consists of static data from GUI tasks.</data>
