      <data key="d0">Listwise Ranking Models</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Listwise Ranking Models (ListNet, LambdaRank, RankNet) preserve ordinal structure and avoid score compression in explanation quality assessment.</data>
