      <data key="d0">Attention Mechanisms</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Attention mechanisms are used in LLMs to focus on specific parts of the input during processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Attention mechanisms enable the model to focus on specific parts of the input data, improving its ability to capture relevant information.&lt;SEP&gt;Attention mechanisms aggregate patch-level information to make robust predictions at the whole slide level.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-306df29aef0348d52b474a51b48f7864&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-910c57075f353f24182e5f8e12e3d2a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-675ee51b7d127031558c39cb6850d420</data>
