    <node id="AI Systems">
      <data key="d0">AI Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">AI Systems are artificial intelligence entities that operate based on programmed rules and algorithms, raising questions about their moral frameworks.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems are computer programs designed to perform tasks autonomously, with outputs triggering real-world actions.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems are advanced technologies used by firms for various tasks, generating greater productivity gains when deployed effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Systems are capable of generating text and accomplishing goals through sustained interaction.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems are increasingly automating complex tasks, relying on weaker models or limited human oversight for supervision.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bbf5cdde0215fa8979b16920619610f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0344f2843fd85e4347a797b4d49c58fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5beec243d8daa16c9ada33534a32feb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18e0c86d41c3bf130424dd4d09af51e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d44784699c64a5aec415cf1e1bb031fa</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779209314</data>
      <data key="d6" />
