      <data key="d0">Right-to-Act Protocol</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Right-to-Act Protocol is a deterministic, non-compensatory pre-execution decision layer that evaluates whether an AI-generated decision is permitted to be realized at all.&lt;SEP&gt;The Right-to-Act Protocol is a pre-execution decision layer for AI systems that evaluates the legitimacy of their decisions before execution.</data>
