      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">Gemini 2.5 Flash is an AI platform used to build the ITAS tutoring system.&lt;SEP&gt;Gemini 2.5 Flash is an AI system that shows a lower but still significant bias in its responses compared to Claude Sonnet 4.5 and GPT-5.4.&lt;SEP&gt;Gemini 2.5 Flash is an AI model used for various tasks, including clinical reasoning and risk assessment.</data>
