    <node id="Meta-Model">
      <data key="d0">Meta-Model</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The meta-model is a trained model that combines the outputs of base models to improve prediction diversity and generalization.&lt;SEP&gt;The meta-model predicts whether a base deep neural network will succeed or fail in predicting a particular data sample by observing its performance on a given learning task.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c3a64e8f23903aab3f6bb572e5e0e8dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdf1461f501421d7355a407fc4a62d1c</data>
