      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Non-equilibrium thermodynamics is a concept used in the Kerimov-Alekberli model, formally linked to stochastic control for AI safety.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d10488f697007297062eb31177c84c90</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779157746</data>
