    <node id="Stochastic Control">
      <data key="d0">Stochastic Control</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Stochastic control is a method used in the Kerimov-Alekberli model to achieve ethical alignment of autonomous systems.</data>
