      <data key="d0">Aligned Reflective Capacity</data>
      <data key="d1">metric</data>
      <data key="d2">Aligned reflective capacity is another internal structural proxy used in the framework to capture how internal structure may modulate the impact of uncertainty.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ddabb643ad7982794978859b96daf403</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779158380</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Task Utility">
      <data key="d0">Task Utility</data>
      <data key="d1">metric</data>
      <data key="d2">Task utility is a measure of model performance used in the proposed formulation to integrate task-specific objectives with stability analysis.</data>
