    <node id="Vision Language Models (VLMs)">
      <data key="d0">Vision Language Models (VLMs)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Vision Language Models are another type of AI model that have demonstrated strong performance on reasoning tasks, but they also struggle with interactive causal learning.&lt;SEP&gt;VLMs are models that can process and understand both text and images.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9c498a8ef8a91dd7345a0bc0c56faeed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1db73b95d2d4357d5595446b233ad0be</data>
