    <node id="Artificial Intelligence (AI)">
      <data key="d0">Artificial Intelligence (AI)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Artificial Intelligence refers to the broader field of research and development that includes Large Language Models and Vision Language Models.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial Intelligence is a technology that enables machines to perform tasks that typically require human intelligence, such as learning and problem-solving.&lt;SEP&gt;Artificial intelligence is a technology increasingly integrated into higher education, raising questions about transparency in reporting AI-assisted work.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9c498a8ef8a91dd7345a0bc0c56faeed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5051fefc63fba8bbe15b427a9ce68480&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f41be395492fbaac3392c09ecad51d45</data>
