    <node id="QEVA">
      <data key="d0">QEVA</data>
      <data key="d1">metric</data>
      <data key="d2">QEVA is a reference-free evaluation metric for narrative video summarization with multimodal question answering, assessing summaries along three dimensions: Coverage, Factuality, and Chronology.&lt;SEP&gt;QEVA evaluates candidate summaries directly against source videos through multimodal question answering.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-552bb61c73a50be34b0ce1f0e3babf25</data>
