      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">AI agents are the subject of evaluation using AgentPulse.&lt;SEP&gt;AI agents are increasingly deployed to execute tasks and make decisions within agentic workflows, introducing new requirements for safe and controlled autonomy.&lt;SEP&gt;AI agents are deployed on complex human workflows, driving growth in LLM token consumption.</data>
