      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">CSMA compounds skill gains via a four-layer persistent memory architecture and Axiom Crystallisation Promotion (ACP) for security awareness training.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6a28f457d7129242bbaed593d2487b9d</data>
