    <node id="Multi-Agent Frameworks">
      <data key="d0">Multi-Agent Frameworks</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Multi-agent frameworks also improve robustness and interpretability, but may require repeated retrieval and complex orchestration.</data>
