      <data key="d0">Scattered Forest Search (SFS)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Scattered Forest Search (SFS) is a state-of-the-art method for multi-turn code correction, employing Monte Carlo Tree Search with carefully crafted initial seeds and textual optimization.</data>
