      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">DecompKAN is a lightweight attention-free architecture for long-term time series forecasting that combines trend-residual decomposition, channel-wise patching, learned instance normalization, and B-spline Kolmogorov-Arnold Network (KAN) edge functions.</data>
