      <data key="d0">Combinatorial Optimization</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Combinatorial optimization is a mathematical approach used to allocate atoms on a fine grid of predefined discrete positions within a unit cell while minimizing their interaction energy.</data>
