      <data key="d0">MITRE ATT&amp;CK Techniques</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">MITRE ATT&amp;CK techniques are a framework for characterizing cyber adversary behavior, linked to vulnerabilities in the SMSI pipeline.</data>
