    <node id="SecureBERT+">
      <data key="d0">SecureBERT+</data>
      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">SecureBERT+ is a fine-tuned language model used in the SMSI pipeline for CVE-to-ATT&amp;CK mapping and ATT&amp;CK-to-NIST control recommendation.</data>
