      <data key="d0">LSTM Module</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The LSTM module forecasts future queue length, waiting time, vehicle count, and lane occupancy based on recent intersection-level observations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5afcc78472e920445d94dd9f10ec59ab</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779165849</data>
