      <data key="d0">Generator Fine-Tuning</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Generator fine-tuning is a traditional approach for adapting generative models by fine-tuning certain layers of the network, but it is not feasible due to storage and access constraints.</data>
