      <data key="d0">Output Filtering</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Output filtering is a defense mechanism that checks the model's responses via hardcoded rules in separate application code before they reach the user, achieving zero leaks across 15,000 attacks.</data>
