      <data key="d0">Dataset for Open-Ended Legal Reasoning Performance Evaluation</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">The dataset is based on the writing component of the Japanese bar examination and evaluates LLMs' generated responses by legal experts.</data>
