      <data key="d0">DxChain</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">DxChain is a methodological innovation in the field of clinical decision support, which transforms the diagnostic workflow into an iterative process by mirroring a clinician's cognitive trajectory.</data>
