      <data key="d0">Electronic Health Records (EHRs)</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">Electronic Health Records (EHRs) are unstructured data used for processing by large language models, which can lead to diagnostic hallucinations.&lt;SEP&gt;EHRs are long, heterogeneous documents containing patient information used in patient-trial matching.</data>
