    <node id="Field-Programmable Gate Arrays (FPGAs)">
      <data key="d0">Field-Programmable Gate Arrays (FPGAs)</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">FPGAs are resource-constrained devices used for deploying artificial neural networks, requiring efficient hardware implementation of nonlinear functions like the sigmoid.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7e63184f8475817efd492ed80ef98cb6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779177344</data>
