      <data key="d1">metric</data>
      <data key="d2">Uncertainty in LLM-Based Systems refers to the lack of confidence or precision in model outputs, which can propagate and compound if not properly addressed.&lt;SEP&gt;Perceived uncertainty also contributes to evaluation apprehension, which in turn reduces disclosure intention and psychological safety.</data>
