      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Hybrid JIT-CUDA Graph Optimization is a framework that combines Just-In-Time compilation with CUDA Graph execution to reduce inference latency and kernel launch overhead for Large Language Models (LLMs).</data>
