      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">MLLMs are large language models that have shown strong capabilities in perception, reasoning, and generation.&lt;SEP&gt;MLLMs are large language models capable of processing multiple input modalities, which are evolving towards complex navigation tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Multimodal Large Language Models are advanced models that still face challenges in fine-grained multi-image understanding.&lt;SEP&gt;MLLMs are large language models that can process and understand multiple input modalities, including text, images, and videos.</data>
