    <node id="Mamba State-Space Update Process">
      <data key="d0">Mamba State-Space Update Process</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mamba state-space update process is an algorithmic component of the AdaMamba framework that models long-range dependencies in time series data.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c4d3f5bf88d1c43459b79a491fd32f08</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779188021</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Interactive Patch Encoding Module">
      <data key="d0">Interactive Patch Encoding Module</data>
      <data key="d1">component</data>
      <data key="d2">The interactive patch encoding module is a part of the AdaMamba framework that captures inter-variable interaction dynamics in time series data.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c4d3f5bf88d1c43459b79a491fd32f08</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779188021</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Adaptive Frequency-Gated State-Space Module">
      <data key="d0">Adaptive Frequency-Gated State-Space Module</data>
      <data key="d1">component</data>
      <data key="d2">The adaptive frequency-gated state-space module generates input-dependent frequency bases and generalizes the temporal forgetting gate into a unified time-frequency forgetting gate.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c4d3f5bf88d1c43459b79a491fd32f08</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779188025</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Unified Time-Frequency Forgetting Gate">
      <data key="d0">Unified Time-Frequency Forgetting Gate</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The unified time-frequency forgetting gate is an algorithmic component of the AdaMamba framework that dynamically calibrates state transitions based on learned frequency-domain importance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c4d3f5bf88d1c43459b79a491fd32f08</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779188025</data>
