      <data key="d0">Protecting the Trace: A Principled Black-Box Approach Against Distillation Attacks</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Protecting the Trace is a research paper addressing concerns about model security and intellectual privacy.</data>
