    <node id="UNSEEN Defense">
      <data key="d0">UNSEEN Defense</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The UNSEEN defense combines an AR ACL, F-RMU-based LLM unlearning, and runtime agent guardrails to address the challenges of securing resource-constrained devices and implementing fine-grained access control within opaque LLM inferences.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-48a4a658e93da7ba77d376aa7954dd6c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
