      <data key="d0">AI Deployment Paradox</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The AI Deployment Paradox refers to the situation where better AI can lead firms to deploy less when capability is deployed through broader authority exposure under weak governance.</data>
