      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">CLIP is a model used as part of the evaluation suite for 3D asset banks, specifically for cross-modal coherence protocol.&lt;SEP&gt;CLIP is a multimodal foundation model used as a pre-trained vision encoder.&lt;SEP&gt;CLIP is a model used for image-text alignment, which optimizes the global [CLS] token rather than spatial selectivity.</data>
