      <data key="d0">Hard to See, Hard to Label: Generative and Symbolic Acquisition for Subtle Visual Phenomena</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">The paper "Hard to See, Hard to Label" is a research study on generative and symbolic acquisition for subtle visual phenomena.</data>
