    <node id="GSAL (Generative-Symbolic Acquisition for Subtle Visual Phenomena)">
      <data key="d0">GSAL (Generative-Symbolic Acquisition for Subtle Visual Phenomena)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">GSAL is an active learning framework for object detection that combines a diffusion-based difficulty signal with a hierarchical semantic coverage prior.</data>
