    <node id="Diffusion-Based Difficulty Signal">
      <data key="d0">Diffusion-Based Difficulty Signal</data>
      <data key="d1">component</data>
      <data key="d2">The diffusion component scores images and proposals using reconstruction discrepancy and denoising variability, prioritizing visually atypical or ambiguous examples.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-db96549eb43108a6eb81fcd95f81ad4e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779194429</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Hierarchical Semantic Coverage Prior">
      <data key="d0">Hierarchical Semantic Coverage Prior</data>
      <data key="d1">component</data>
      <data key="d2">The semantic component organizes candidate samples in a three-level concept graph and promotes coverage of underrepresented semantic regions while providing interpretable acquisition rationales.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-db96549eb43108a6eb81fcd95f81ad4e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
