    <node id="Towards Causally Interpretable Wi-Fi CSI-Based Human Activity Recognition with Discrete Latent Compression and LTL Rule Extraction">
      <data key="d0">Towards Causally Interpretable Wi-Fi CSI-Based Human Activity Recognition with Discrete Latent Compression and LTL Rule Extraction</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">This paper presents a method for human activity recognition using Wi-Fi Channel State Information (CSI) that addresses causal interpretability, symbolic controllability, and direct operation on high-dimensional raw signals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-75b1e120664fd0493cc36157d635b118</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
