      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">This dataset is used for evaluating the performance of the proposed method, which indicates competitive performance while preserving explicit temporal and causal structure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-75b1e120664fd0493cc36157d635b118</data>
