      <data key="d0">Peer Identity Bias</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Peer Identity Bias refers to the phenomenon where large language models (LLMs) exhibit biased behavior towards peer model identities, affecting their performance and decision-making processes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e362b1abd07592b478809f67c6a95bd</data>
