    <node id="Plan Existence Problem">
      <data key="d0">Plan Existence Problem</data>
      <data key="d1">task</data>
      <data key="d2">The Plan Existence Problem asks whether a sequence of epistemic actions can be applied to reach a goal in modal logic, given an initial epistemic state and set of actions.</data>
