      <data key="d0">Privilege-Narrowing</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Privilege-narrowing is a mechanism used by the Reconstructive Authority Model to dynamically adjust privileges based on coverage levels.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c76cc454c5e1f693609cbf2d13755e39</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
