      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">RCSR is a personalization-friendly federated framework for integrating prototype anchoring, semantic routing, and adapter personalization.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9d10efc0c92804139d9299a38bbb33d5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
