      <data key="d0">Disaster-Induced Change Query (DICQ)</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">The DICQ dataset is a large-scale benchmark coupling pre-event optical semantics with post-event SAR structural features across a balanced distribution of natural catastrophes and armed conflicts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f110f83c4981b4fb0a0f629368577657</data>
