    <node id="Foundation Models">
      <data key="d0">Foundation Models</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Foundation Models are pre-trained models that aim to learn generalizable patterns and have shown superior performance in multiple prediction tasks, including energy time series forecasting.&lt;SEP&gt;Foundation models are future large language models that remain vulnerable to adversarial manipulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Foundation models are a type of brain model used for predicting brain disorders by modeling dynamic functional connectivity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce1c37c5b36081e4b5e6571b03199e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8084488ac0f355725aa1f5bce383f709&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae2152d2284f8170320df7e3693c988c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779211738</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Energy Time Series Forecasting">
      <data key="d0">Energy Time Series Forecasting</data>
      <data key="d1">task</data>
      <data key="d2">Energy Time Series Forecasting is a critical task for planning and operation in the transition towards a climate-neutral energy system.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce1c37c5b36081e4b5e6571b03199e12</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779203364</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Climate-Neutral Energy System">
      <data key="d0">Climate-Neutral Energy System</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A climate-neutral energy system refers to an energy system that does not produce greenhouse gas emissions, requiring accurate forecasting for planning and operation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce1c37c5b36081e4b5e6571b03199e12</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779203364</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Dataset-Specific Machine Learning">
      <data key="d0">Dataset-Specific Machine Learning</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Dataset-specific machine learning approaches require comprehensive training data and are limited in scalability, resulting in high model development and maintenance effort.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce1c37c5b36081e4b5e6571b03199e12</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779203368</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Energy Forecasting Use Cases">
      <data key="d0">Energy Forecasting Use Cases</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Energy forecasting use cases involve stakeholders, attributes, and data categories, guiding the selection of datasets for benchmarking foundation models.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce1c37c5b36081e4b5e6571b03199e12</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
