      <data key="d1">metric</data>
      <data key="d2">Two novel semantic metrics tailored to ASP code generation are provided by BLAST.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-42ee7e1b46f70cd546b17a0419da6891</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779203543</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Graph-Related Problems">
      <data key="d0">Graph-Related Problems</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">Ten well-established graph-related problems from the ASP literature are used in the empirical evaluation of BLAST.</data>
