      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The proposed framework is a concept that enables robots to handle uncovered tasks in open environments through autonomous learning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70ca0e5d7abfb4851dc541e18cb0657f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
