      <data key="d0">Generative Recommendation (GR)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Generative Recommendation offers superior modeling capabilities but suffers from high inference costs due to repeated encoding of user histories.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3dc81f5a7528411e1220bc62eebacde1</data>
