      <data key="d0">Key-Value (KV) Cache Reuse</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Cross-request KV cache reuse presents a significant optimization opportunity for GR models.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3dc81f5a7528411e1220bc62eebacde1</data>
