    <node id="Actor MFU">
      <data key="d0">Actor MFU</data>
      <data key="d1">metric</data>
      <data key="d2">Actor MFU (mean first update) is a metric that measures the average time it takes for the actor to update its policy after receiving new information from the critic.</data>
