    <node id="Computer Vision Systems">
      <data key="d0">Computer Vision Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Existing computer vision systems lack a unified approach that works across diverse settings, such as sparse moving dots, textured surfaces, or naturalistic scenes.</data>
