    <node id="Random Dot Kinematograms">
      <data key="d0">Random Dot Kinematograms</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">The model operates on different kinds of inputs, including 2D random dot kinematograms, enabling it to work across settings where biological vision succeeds but existing computer vision approaches do not.</data>
