      <data key="d0">Gestalt-Inspired Dataset</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">The Gestalt-inspired dataset consists of camouflaged rotating objects, which the model recovers correct 3D structure from motion and thereby accurate 2D object segmentation.</data>
