    <node id="Naturalistic RGB Videos">
      <data key="d0">Naturalistic RGB Videos</data>
      <data key="d1">dataset</data>
      <data key="d2">The model tracks the moving 3D matter that makes up deforming objects in naturalistic RGB videos, enabling robust object-level scene understanding.</data>
