      <data key="d0">Reasoning LLMs</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Reasoning Large Language Models (LLMs) are evaluated using ESRRSim to assess their risk profiles and detection rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Reasoning LLMs are a type of model that often spend substantial tokens on long intermediate reasoning traces when solving new problems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e8778c4326e5372d8016fc296ebdc67e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba5e4a7e12c31bf680a83aa4213bacce</data>
