    <node id="Hallucinated Content">
      <data key="d0">Hallucinated Content</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Hallucinated content refers to altered or enhanced image features, such as edges or texture, which may mislead users about the authenticity of their camera images.</data>
