      <data key="d0">Image-Specific Multi-Layer Perceptron (MLP) Decoder</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Our approach uses an MLP decoder optimized for each specific image to recover the unaltered version of the camera image.</data>
