      <data key="d0">Outcome Variance</data>
      <data key="d1">metric</data>
      <data key="d2">Algorithmic examples show it is possible to reduce outcome variance for disadvantaged groups while preserving institutional objectives (e.g. expected utility).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fe7fc82733330af762752cd6e70c474d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779218176</data>
