      <data key="d0">Rectified Linear Unit (ReLU)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Rectified Linear Unit (ReLU) is the dominant choice for activation function due to its simplicity and effectiveness, but lacks smoothness which may hinder gradient-based optimization.</data>
