      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Deductive ASPIC$-$ is a framework that has made significant progress in structured argumentation but falls short of meeting all rationality postulates simultaneously under a credulous semantics (e.g. preferred) in the presence of undercuts.</data>
