      <data key="d0">Residual Graph Isomorphism Network integrated with an Attention mechanism (ResGIN-Att)</data>
      <data key="d1">model</data>
      <data key="d2">The ResGIN-Att model integrates molecular structural features and cell-line genomic profiles with drug-drug interactions to enhance the prediction of synergistic effects.</data>
