    <node id="Dynamical Prior Reinforcement Learning (DP-RL)">
      <data key="d0">Dynamical Prior Reinforcement Learning (DP-RL)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">DP-RL is a training framework for reinforcement learning that incorporates an auxiliary loss derived from external state dynamics to shape the temporal evolution of action probabilities during learning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-505d76e0ef7c1c2d1377c1c2c9d16f54</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779224055</data>
