      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779228054</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Visual Modality Collapse">
      <data key="d0">Visual Modality Collapse</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c6bcf86f6a5a967b301b93060c890f68</data>
      <data key="d2">Marvel exhibits visual modality collapse, where it disregards visual features while depending excessively on textual cues.</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1779228058</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Semantic Misalignment">
      <data key="d0">Semantic Misalignment</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c6bcf86f6a5a967b301b93060c890f68</data>
      <data key="d2">Although UniVL-DR is less affected by visual modality collapse, it is more susceptible to semantic misalignment, where semantically related content is positioned far apart in the embedding space.</data>
