    <node id="NTIRE 2026 Remote Sensing Infrared Image Super-Resolution Challenge">
      <data key="d0">NTIRE 2026 Remote Sensing Infrared Image Super-Resolution Challenge</data>
      <data key="d1">task</data>
      <data key="d2">The NTIRE 2026 Remote Sensing Infrared Image Super-Resolution Challenge is a benchmark to advance research in infrared image super-resolution and promote the development of effective solutions for real-world remote sensing applications.</data>
