      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">CuTile reaches 52-79% of cuBLAS performance in GEMM benchmarks, making it a practical replacement for hand-written CUDA kernels but not yet for vendor-optimized libraries.&lt;SEP&gt;CuTile is compared to cuBLAS in terms of performance and code complexity, showing potential as a practical replacement for hand-written CUDA kernels.</data>
