    <edge source="Client-Level Disagreements" target="A Taxonomy and Resolution Strategy for Client-Level Disagreements in Federated Learning">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">This paper addresses the gap of client-level disagreements by introducing a taxonomy and proposing a robust resolution strategy.</data>
