    <edge source="Neurosymbolic systems" target="Reasoning Shortcuts">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Neurosymbolic systems can satisfy logical constraints during learning without achieving the intended concept-label correspondence, which is a problem known as reasoning shortcuts.</data>
