    <edge source="Utility-Aware Data Pricing" target="Data Shapley Values">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Data shapley values measure the contribution of data to the capabilities of a Large Language Model according to the Utility-Aware Data Pricing framework.</data>
