    </edge>
    <edge source="L2C" target="Cluster Level Methods">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">L2C bridges the gap between local structure learning and cluster level causal discovery, enabling macro causal reasoning.&lt;SEP&gt;L2C relaxes the assumption of known clusters and causal sufficiency required by Cluster Level Methods.</data>
      <data key="d9">assumption relaxation,causal sufficiency,macro causal reasoning,unified framework</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-f1a24029d326af9c339a12a60c5c2246</data>
