    </edge>
    <edge source="Graph Transformers" target="Distance-Misaligned Training">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Graph Transformers are prone to failure modes due to their flexibility in mixing information globally, which can lead to distance-misaligned training.</data>
