    <edge source="Distance-Misaligned Training" target="Graph Distance Bias">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Distance-misaligned training is related to graph distance bias, as it refers to the mismatch between where label-relevant information lies and where the model allocates communication over graph distance.</data>
