    </edge>
    <edge source="Gradient Modification" target="Decoupled Moment Routing">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Decoupled moment routing falls below vanilla at 14.1, while adaptive decoupled routing remains stable at 9.4 and improves over vanilla by 3.8 units.</data>
      <data key="d9">method comparison,performance improvement</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-350265fa6cfa6c36f900b8cfb64b92be</data>
