    <edge source="Thinking with Reasoning Skills" target="Reasoning From Scratch Paradigm">
      <data key="d7">1.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Unlike the prevailing paradigm of reasoning from scratch, our approach first recalls relevant skills for each query, helping the model avoid redundant detours and focus on effective solution paths.</data>
