      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">ASPIC-style Structured Argumentation Frameworks provide a formal basis for reasoning in artificial intelligence but fall short of meeting all rationality postulates simultaneously under a credulous semantics (e.g. preferred) in the presence of undercuts.&lt;SEP&gt;Deductive ASPIC$-$ has made significant progress in structured argumentation but falls short of meeting all rationality postulates simultaneously under a credulous semantics (e.g. preferred) in the presence of undercuts.</data>
